Complete End-to-End Plan: IntelliJ Debugger MCP Server for Rovo Dev

## Product Vision

Goal: Enable Rovo Dev (and other MCP clients) to autonomously debug Kotlin codebases through full programmatic control of IntelliJ IDEA's debugger, eliminating manual debugging workflows.

Success Metric: Developer says "Debug why X is broken" and the agent fully investigates, identifies root cause, and suggests fixes without any manual debugging steps.

